;
; This file is part of a redirection package,
; make sure you have all of the following files.
;
; 3B-17.LBL
; 3B0-919-xxx.LBL
; 3B0-920-xx2.LBL
; 3B0-920-xx7.LBL
; 3B0-920-xx9.LBL
; 3B7-920-xx6.LBL
;
; by Sebastian Stange (sebastian@ross-tech.com)
;
; last modification: 27/Oct/2005
;
; requires VAG-COM 405.0 or newer
;
